caption: Overview
technology-rule: overview

Chems are technological drugs that temporarily grant advantages, attribute increases, or other beneficial traits. They are designed using the normal GURPS invention rules. Every Chem counts as a Temporary Physical buff, regardless of any supernatural origin assigned to its granted abilities.
